{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12203090","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12203090","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1220309001:0":{"text":"请问你是拉夫特先生吗？我们有几个问题想找你打听。","source_cn":"请问你是拉夫特先生吗？我们有几个问题想找你打听。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6548D05CA67861B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220309002:0":{"text":"老、老鼠！又是大老鼠？！","source_cn":"老、老鼠！又是大老鼠？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62C9B24DD8038BC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220309003:0":{"text":"真失礼……就算没有亲眼见过魔法师的使魔，起码也听说过吧。","source_cn":"真失礼……就算没有亲眼见过魔法师的使魔，起码也听说过吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x622010A10600A8EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220309004:0":{"text":"使魔……魔法师都喜欢用大老鼠当使魔吗？我看见的那东西，难道也是使魔？","source_cn":"使魔……魔法师都喜欢用大老鼠当使魔吗？我看见的那东西，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19AC43B8384BA9C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220309005:0":{"text":"唉……我有必要给锈锚港的人普及一些魔法常识了。","source_cn":"唉……我有必要给锈锚港的人普及一些魔法常识了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC48CEE7F940BCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","d